[146.327729, "o", "- **2026-08-09 03:12:49 UTC**: Attacker attempted exploit payload (`/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:298`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\rsis\r\n\u001b[?2004h> - **2026-08-09 03:20:00 UTC**: EDR high-severity alert cluster triggered and incident opened (`/sas/handoff/intake.pdf:1`, `/sas/alerts.json:2`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **2026-08-09 (Post-compromise)**: Attacker planted PHP webshell at `/disk/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact/inc.php:4`, planted cron persistence at `/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/www-data:5`, modified `.htaccess` for traffic redirection (`/disk/var/www/html/.htaccess:2`), defaced `index.html` (`/disk/var/www/html/index.html:1`), and wiped cache binary (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \"\"\"\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> intrusion_content = \"\"\"# Incident Intrusion Report\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ## Executive Summary\r\n\u001b[?2004l\rat\u001b[?2004h> An external attacker operating from IP address `198.51.100.40` compromised the target host `wordpress-prod-01`. The attack sequence involved initial exploitation and SSH brute-force access, planting of a PHP webshell backdoor, website defacement, malicious traffic redirection via `.htaccess`, cron-based persistent beaconing, and anti-forensic wiping of cache artifacts. While endpoint monitoring alerted on the webshell and defacement, silent persistence and anti-forensic activities were uncovered during disk forensics.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
